+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 3, Theorem 1 gives an O(m)+2^{O(k^2)} general "
+        "algorithm, while XOR-block extraction and GF(2) elimination solve this "
+        "distribution in O(m log m+n^3); shipping measurements are filled from "
