-# MAX-3-SAT above the tight lower bound (arXiv:0907.4573)
+# MAX-3-SAT above a tight lower bound — arXiv:0907.4573
 
-| Profile field | Value |
+| Profile | Value |
 |---|---|
 | Track | **B — no-tool compression** |
