codex
The revised shipping family now survives a genuine 32-restart parity-aware local repair attack on 0/8 seeds; the former high-decoy preset was broken 8/8 by that attack and has been discarded. The solver is now given exact parity summaries alongside the native clauses, so the claimed post-insight route is honestly 288 XORs rather than thousands of hidden reconstruction steps. I’m running the required bare oracle ladder next.
