codex
At the 144-variable rung, one oracle has already solved an instance and one has failed, so that rung cannot hold. The harness is completing the third attempt, after which the only remaining legal escalation is \(n=150\) (exactly 300 XORs after the insight); anything larger is correctly classified as `cap_bound`, not as a failure of the paper.
